{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/11892-the-prettiest-dice-ever-behold","id":11892,"title":"The Prettiest Dice Ever! BEHOLD!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-15T22:15:24-08:00","id":11892,"title":"The Prettiest Dice Ever! BEHOLD!","content":"One of my gaming friends shared this website with me. It is seriously the best thing ever! These guys in Dallas did a Kickstarter and now have their own company that makes custom-crafted gaming dice out of exotic woods and metal. It is seriously awesome. Check out their website! I'm getting some Purple Heart d10s for Christmas!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.artisandice.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.artisandice.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/04/adlogo.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.artisandice.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> Artisan Dice | Handcrafted Dice for the Discerning Gamer </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.artisandice.com/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.artisandice.com/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> [ATTACH=CONFIG]n86[/ATTACH]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-15T23:26:58-08:00","id":11919,"title":"","content":"That is pretty awesome <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/657-skafte","name":"skafte","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T06:11:49-08:00","id":12021,"title":"","content":"They look very nice, Telgar. Enjoy them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-16T06:16:37-08:00","id":12023,"title":"","content":"...those actually look really nice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><span style=\"color:darkred\">Got an angel on the left hand and a devil on the right<br /> She's gonna raise a little hell up in heaven tonight---Vixen</span></i></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"color:olive\"><i>When you say it's all divine and meant to be<br /> What about your flesh and blood and defiers like me?---Avantasia</i></span></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/821-rayvin-miyu","name":"Rayvin Miyu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar821_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T09:08:47-08:00","id":14093,"title":"","content":"I picked a quartet of redwood burl fudge dice when the Kickstarter ran. They're very light, but easy to read and just as variable as any other 4dF. They aren't so light they go flying off the table, but if you're deadset on a tactile exactness of plastic dice, they're not going to do it for you. <br /> <br /> They <i>smell</i> totally rad, though! I kind of wish I'd gotten cedar but as a former coastal Californian, redwood was necessary.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Freelancer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17-metrophelean","name":"Metrophelean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T09:50:35-08:00","id":14128,"title":"","content":"They are pretty...damned expensive.<br /> <br /> But pretty.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T10:58:09-08:00","id":14175,"title":"","content":"They are expensive, but I'm an artist myself and I understand the costs involved in small-scale custom production of art objects. That's what these dice are: art. Usable, functional art, but still art. If you just want dice that produce random numbers, plastic is far and away the more economical and reasonable option. If you want some amazing craftsmanship, gorgeous woods and unique items to own and coo over that won't just end up sitting on a shelf or in a forgotten knicknack box, then they're the best things ever. As much as I love nonfunctional ceramics or other forms of visual sculpture, you can't <i>do</i> anything with them but look at 'em. These dice are just as pretty as most sculpture, but they're also something that will see use fairly often.<br /> <br /> Oh, and instead of getting the Purple Heart d10s, I ended up splitting a set of d20s with my best friend. The four d20s are in this photo below, along with the Purple Heart box they're shipping to us in.<br /> <br /> [ATTACH=CONFIG]n98[/ATTACH]<br /> <br /> When they arrive, I will be sure to post how they roll and feel. ArtisanDice says they'll have random selections of d10's available &quot;soon&quot;, and I might hold off on purchasing d10s until then, because I want a bunch of different types of wood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}